{"id": "16-2242-2-4", "zh": "词根 sā，义为煮熟。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2242-5-6", "zh": "sināti（煮熟）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2243-2-4", "zh": "词根 su，义为伤害。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2243-5-6", "zh": "suṇāti（伤害）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2243-7-8", "zh": "parasu（斧头）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2243-9-14", "zh": "人们用它来伤害、杀害他人，所以叫作 parasu（斧头）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2244-2-4", "zh": "词根 asa，义为吃。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2244-5-7", "zh": "吃所播种之物的果实。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2244-8-9", "zh": "asana（食物）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2245-2-6", "zh": "这里的 asana 是指食物。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2245-7-18", "zh": "因为它被吃、被享用，所以叫作“asana”。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2245-19-29", "zh": "“你们吃吧、嚼吧、喝吧”，这就是这里的例证。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "16-2246-2-4", "zh": "词根 kilisa，义为折磨。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "16-2246-5-6", "zh": "kilisnāti（折磨）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2246-7-8", "zh": "kilesa（烦恼）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2247-2-9", "zh": "这里所说的**烦恼**，既指贪等，也指苦。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2248-2-4", "zh": "词根 uddhasa，义为拾取。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2248-5-7", "zh": "拾取就是寻求。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2248-8-9", "zh": "uddhasnāti（拾取）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2249-2-5", "zh": "词根 isa，义为反复。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2249-6-7", "zh": "isnāti（反复）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2250-2-4", "zh": "词根 visa，义为分离。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2250-5-6", "zh": "visnāti（分离）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2250-7-8", "zh": "visa（毒）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2251-2-4", "zh": "词根 pusa，义为润泽、流出、充满。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2251-5-6", "zh": "pusnāti（润泽）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2252-2-4", "zh": "词根 pusa，义为养育。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "16-2252-5-6", "zh": "pusnāti（养育）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2253-2-4", "zh": "词根 musa，义为偷盗。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2253-5-6", "zh": "musnāti（偷盗）。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "16-2253-7-8", "zh": "musala（杵）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2254-2-9", "zh": "以 kī 为首的这些词根，是我尽自己的能力所见到的；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2255-2-7", "zh": "其余的也请到经典中去查看，按意义是否相应来采用。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2256-2-5", "zh": "这些词根有出自教法的，也有出自世间的；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2257-2-5", "zh": "其中出自世间的也列了出来，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2258-2-3", "zh": "那是为了有助于教法，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2259-2-4", "zh": "才说了与之相应的那些。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2260-2-4", "zh": "以上是以 kī 为首的词根类。", "confidence": 88}
